<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates steady.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates steady.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound were steady in the private sector market on Wednesday at between 10-1/8 and 10-1/4 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates were also unchanged at between 10-1/8 and 10-1/4 percent, they added but one banker said he traded at 10 percent.</p>
<p>State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
